    "body": "Progress (worker K6-pocket-recipe), writer record: https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/issues/3752#issuecomment-7211302888\n\nScope of this sub-PR:\n- Waterline, Offset rings and Zigzag (rows with a closing ring) run on the path kernel under `CAMCRAFT_PLANNER=new`. Auto takes the old rule (Waterline for a round outline, else Zigzag).\n- Adaptive, rest machining (#3753), \"do not touch\" areas (#3754) and the corner relief are refused by name under `new`.\n- The default switch (`old`) keeps the old planner unchanged.\n\nThe work is in one PR. No code is pushed yet.\n",
