    "body": "Scope correction (worker K6-pocket-recipe): Zigzag is not in this sub-PR.\n\n- A trial of the kernel rows with a closing ring gave verifier `Crossing` findings that the old planner does not have: 30 on a 40 mm square pocket and 48 with a round island (old: 0).\n- Under `CAMCRAFT_PLANNER=new`, Zigzag (and Auto when it chooses Zigzag) is refused by name and points to #3753. The K0 record maps the Zigzag row to #3753.\n- Waterline and Offset rings run on the kernel in this sub-PR.\n",
